          "code": "import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# First-Principles: Schema-Locked ColumnRouter vs Bencana pd.get_dummies() Terpisah\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\ndf_train = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"age\": [24.0, 35.0, 42.0, 29.0, 51.0, 38.0],\n    \"income_m\": [6.5, 14.0, 22.0, 9.5, 31.0, 17.5],\n    \"channel\": [\"APP\", \"WEB\", \"APP\", \"PARTNER\", \"WEB\", \"APP\"],\n})\n# Batch produksi datang dengan (1) URUTAN KOLOM BERUBAH, (2) KATEGORI BARU \"LIVE_2026\",\n# dan (3) satu kategori lama (\"PARTNER\") tidak muncul pada mini-batch hari ini!\ndf_serve = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"channel\": [\"LIVE_2026\", \"WEB\", \"APP\"],\n    \"income_m\": [18.0, 12.0, 8.0],\n    \"age\": [33.0, 28.0, 45.0],\n})\n\n# 1) ANTI-PATTERN: pd.get_dummies() terpisah pada train dan serve\nX_tr_bad = pd.get_dummies(df_train, columns=[\"channel\"], dtype=float)\nX_sv_bad = pd.get_dummies(df_serve, columns=[\"channel\"], dtype=float)\n\n# Bobot model linier yang dilatih pada urutan kolom X_tr_bad:\n#   [age, income_m, channel_APP, channel_PARTNER, channel_WEB]\nw_model = np.array([0.05, 0.12, -0.40, 0.85, 0.20])\n# Skor salah karena memaksa array numpy X_sv_bad yang urutan & nama kolomnya bergeser!\nscore_bad = X_sv_bad.to_numpy() @ w_model  # Kolom 0 ternyata income_m, bukan age!\n\n# 2) FIRST-PRINCIPLES: Schema-Locked ColumnTransformer (Mengunci nama, urutan, & kamus kategori saat fit)\nclass SchemaLockedTransformer:\n    def __init__(self, num_cols: list[str], cat_cols: list[str]):\n        self.num_cols = list(num_cols)\n        self.cat_cols = list(cat_cols)\n\n    def fit(self, df: pd.DataFrame) -> \"SchemaLockedTransformer\":\n        self.num_mean_ = {c: float(df[c].mean()) for c in self.num_cols}\n        self.num_std_ = {c: float(df[c].std(ddof=0) or 1.0) for c in self.num_cols}\n        self.cat_vocab_ = {c: sorted(df[c].dropna().astype(str).unique().tolist()) for c in self.cat_cols}\n        self.out_columns_ = list(self.num_cols) + [\n            f\"{c}_{cat}\" for c in self.cat_cols for cat in self.cat_vocab_[c]\n        ]\n        return self\n\n    def transform(self, df: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:\n        missing = [c for c in self.num_cols + self.cat_cols if c not in df.columns]\n        if missing:\n            raise ValueError(f\"Kolom wajib hilang di serving: {missing}\")\n        cols = {}\n        for c in self.num_cols:\n            vals = df[c].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n            cols[c] = (vals - self.num_mean_[c]) / self.num_std_[c]\n        for c in self.cat_cols:\n            raw = df[c].astype(str).to_numpy()\n            for cat in self.cat_vocab_[c]:\n                # Kategori tak dikenal (mis. \"LIVE_2026\") otomatis menjadi vektor nol aman!\n                cols[f\"{c}_{cat}\"] = (raw == cat).astype(float)\n        return pd.DataFrame(cols, columns=self.out_columns_, index=df.index)\n\nrouter = SchemaLockedTransformer(num_cols=[\"age\", \"income_m\"], cat_cols=[\"channel\"]).fit(df_train)\nZ_sv_safe = router.transform(df_serve)\nZ_sv_reordered = router.transform(df_serve[[\"age\", \"channel\", \"income_m\"]])\nperm_parity = float(np.max(np.abs(Z_sv_safe.to_numpy() - Z_sv_reordered.to_numpy())))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Bencana Silent Column-Shift pada pd.get_dummies() ===\")\nprint(f\"Kolom Train (pd.get_dummies) : {list(X_tr_bad.columns)}\")\nprint(f\"Kolom Serve (pd.get_dummies) : {list(X_sv_bad.columns)}  <-- URUTAN & NAMA SALAH TOTAL!\")\nprint(f\"Skor Korup Akibat Shift      : {np.round(score_bad, 3)} (age tertukar income_m, LIVE_2026 tertukar PARTNER!)\")\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. SchemaLockedTransformer (First-Principles ColumnTransformer) ===\")\nprint(f\"Kolom Output Terkunci        : {list(Z_sv_safe.columns)}\")\nprint(f\"Vektor OHE 'LIVE_2026' (row0): {Z_sv_safe.iloc[0, 2:].to_numpy()}  <-- Zero-vector aman!\")\nprint(f\"Max Delta Permutasi Kolom    : {perm_parity:.2e}  <-- 100% Invarian Urutan Kolom!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Bencana Silent Column-Shift pada pd.get_dummies() ===\nKolom Train (pd.get_dummies) : ['age', 'income_m', 'channel_APP', 'channel_PARTNER', 'channel_WEB']\nKolom Serve (pd.get_dummies) : ['income_m', 'age', 'channel_APP', 'channel_LIVE_2026', 'channel_WEB']  <-- URUTAN & NAMA SALAH TOTAL!\nSkor Korup Akibat Shift      : [5.71 4.16 5.4 ] (age tertukar income_m, LIVE_2026 tertukar PARTNER!)\n\n=== 2. SchemaLockedTransformer (First-Principles ColumnTransformer) ===\nKolom Output Terkunci        : ['age', 'income_m', 'channel_APP', 'channel_PARTNER', 'channel_WEB']\nVektor OHE 'LIVE_2026' (row0): [0. 0. 0.]  <-- Zero-vector aman!\nMax Delta Permutasi Kolom    : 0.00e+00  <-- 100% Invarian Urutan Kolom!",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Bencana Silent Column-Shift pada pd.get_dummies() ===\nKolom Train (pd.get_dummies) : ['age', 'income_m', 'channel_APP', 'channel_PARTNER', 'channel_WEB']\nKolom Serve (pd.get_dummies) : ['income_m', 'age', 'channel_APP', 'channel_LIVE_2026', 'channel_WEB']  <-- URUTAN & NAMA SALAH TOTAL!\nSkor Korup Akibat Shift      : [5.71 4.16 5.4 ] (age tertukar income_m, LIVE_2026 tertukar PARTNER!)\n\n=== 2. SchemaLockedTransformer (First-Principles ColumnTransformer) ===\nKolom Output Terkunci        : ['age', 'income_m', 'channel_APP', 'channel_PARTNER', 'channel_WEB']\nVektor OHE 'LIVE_2026' (row0): [0. 0. 0.]  <-- Zero-vector aman!\nMax Delta Permutasi Kolom    : 0.00e+00  <-- 100% Invarian Urutan Kolom!",
          "explanation": "Memperlihatkan kegagalan diam-diam pd.get_dummies() saat kolom serving bergeser dan kategori baru 'LIVE_2026' masuk, lalu membangun SchemaLockedTransformer dari nol yang mengunci nama kolom, memetakan kategori asing ke zero-vector, dan meraih 0.00e+00 delta saat kolom diacak.",
