          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2531)\n\n# Bangkitkan fitur pendapatan dengan ekor berat (log-normal) untuk train (300 baris) & test (80 baris)\nX_train = np.column_stack([\n    rng.lognormal(mean=2.0, sigma=0.7, size=300),\n    rng.normal(loc=40.0, scale=8.0, size=300),\n])\nX_test = np.column_stack([\n    rng.lognormal(mean=2.2, sigma=0.8, size=80),\n    rng.normal(loc=42.0, scale=9.0, size=80),\n])\n# Sisipkan 1 outlier ekstrem di baris 0 untuk menguji pemotongan Winsorizer\nX_test[0, 0] = 250.0\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 1) ANTI-PATTERN: Transformasi Bocor (Menghitung Kuantil & Z-Score di Batch Inferensi!)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\ndef leaky_winsor_zscore(X_batch: np.ndarray, q_hi: float = 0.95) -> np.ndarray:\n    hi = np.quantile(X_batch, q_hi, axis=0)\n    clipped = np.minimum(X_batch, hi)\n    mu = clipped.mean(axis=0)\n    sd = clipped.std(axis=0) + 1e-8\n    return (clipped - mu) / sd\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 2) FIRST-PRINCIPLES: Stateful Fitted Operator (Statistik Dikunci Hanya Dari X_train)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nclass PureFittedWinsorScaler:\n    def __init__(self, q_hi: float = 0.95):\n        self.q_hi = q_hi\n\n    def fit(self, X: np.ndarray) -> \"PureFittedWinsorScaler\":\n        self.hi_ = np.quantile(X, self.q_hi, axis=0)\n        clipped = np.minimum(X, self.hi_)\n        self.mean_ = clipped.mean(axis=0)\n        self.std_ = np.where(clipped.std(axis=0) > 0, clipped.std(axis=0), 1.0)\n        return self\n\n    def transform(self, X: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n        clipped = np.minimum(X, self.hi_)\n        return (clipped - self.mean_) / self.std_\n\nsafe_op = PureFittedWinsorScaler(q_hi=0.95).fit(X_train)\n\n# Bandingkan serving BATCH (N=80) vs serving ONLINE SINGLE-ROW (N=1) untuk baris 0..4!\nleaky_batch = leaky_winsor_zscore(X_test)\nleaky_single_rows = np.vstack([leaky_winsor_zscore(X_test[i : i + 1]) for i in range(5)])\n\nsafe_batch = safe_op.transform(X_test)\nsafe_single_rows = np.vstack([safe_op.transform(X_test[i : i + 1]) for i in range(5)])\n\ndiff_leaky = float(np.max(np.abs(leaky_batch[:5] - leaky_single_rows)))\ndiff_safe = float(np.max(np.abs(safe_batch[:5] - safe_single_rows)))\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Invariansi Ukuran Batch: Batch (N=80) vs Online Single-Row (N=1) ===\")\nprint(f\"Batas Winsor p95 terkunci dari X_train : {np.round(safe_op.hi_, 3)}\")\nprint(f\"Output Leaky (Batch, baris 0)          : {np.round(leaky_batch[0], 4)}\")\nprint(f\"Output Leaky (Single-Row N=1, baris 0) : {np.round(leaky_single_rows[0], 4)}  <-- RUNTUH KE 0.0!\")\nprint(f\"Max |Batch - SingleRow| (Leaky)        : {diff_leaky:.4f}  <-- TRAIN-SERVE SKEW FATAL!\")\nprint(f\"Output Safe  (Batch, baris 0)          : {np.round(safe_batch[0], 4)}\")\nprint(f\"Output Safe  (Single-Row N=1, baris 0) : {np.round(safe_single_rows[0], 4)}\")\nprint(f\"Max |Batch - SingleRow| (Safe Fitted)  : {diff_safe:.2e}  <-- 100% IDENTIK!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Invariansi Ukuran Batch: Batch (N=80) vs Online Single-Row (N=1) ===\nBatas Winsor p95 terkunci dari X_train : [23.813 52.979]\nOutput Leaky (Batch, baris 0)          : [2.3984 0.019 ]\nOutput Leaky (Single-Row N=1, baris 0) : [0. 0.]  <-- RUNTUH KE 0.0!\nMax |Batch - SingleRow| (Leaky)        : 2.3984  <-- TRAIN-SERVE SKEW FATAL!\nOutput Safe  (Batch, baris 0)          : [2.5012 0.6383]\nOutput Safe  (Single-Row N=1, baris 0) : [2.5012 0.6383]\nMax |Batch - SingleRow| (Safe Fitted)  : 0.00e+00  <-- 100% IDENTIK!",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Invariansi Ukuran Batch: Batch (N=80) vs Online Single-Row (N=1) ===\nBatas Winsor p95 terkunci dari X_train : [23.813 52.979]\nOutput Leaky (Batch, baris 0)          : [2.3984 0.019 ]\nOutput Leaky (Single-Row N=1, baris 0) : [0. 0.]  <-- RUNTUH KE 0.0!\nMax |Batch - SingleRow| (Leaky)        : 2.3984  <-- TRAIN-SERVE SKEW FATAL!\nOutput Safe  (Batch, baris 0)          : [2.5012 0.6383]\nOutput Safe  (Single-Row N=1, baris 0) : [2.5012 0.6383]\nMax |Batch - SingleRow| (Safe Fitted)  : 0.00e+00  <-- 100% IDENTIK!",
